From fe062f1cbcccff1c9e70a98e7429eada1f0ceaba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mitch Johnston <mitch.johnston25@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 09:45:21 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] qt: Juxtopposed floating mini player card

Replaces the full width mini player bar and the separate PIP video in the library with the redesign's floating card in the bottom right corner (Figma "Miniplayer", 391x339).

- MiniPlayerCard shows the video (when the compositor supports it) or the cover, a seekable progress line, the title, the media's folder and artist, and a play queue toggle. Hovering the media shows play/pause, open player and stop. Clicking the media opens the player.
- MainDisplay no longer reserves space at the bottom for the mini player. Views get an end margin instead so their last items can scroll out from under the card, and the card moves left when the play queue panel is open.
- Adds an "artist" glyph to the icon font from the design's artist icon.
